ated in Beijing. It plays a crucial role in disseminating news and information that shapes public perception both domestically and internationally. As one of the largest and most influential news organizations globally, Xinhua's significance extends beyond mere reporting; it is a vital instrument of the Chinese government’s communication strategy, reflecting the evolving dynamics of East Asia in the modern era.

